WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.293
First, launch Copilot CLI.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.584
Now type /agent to browse your custom agents.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.186
A picker opens.

00:00:12.186 --> 00:00:15.755
Create a new agent or learn more about custom agents.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.811
Use the arrow keys to move, Enter to select, Escape to cancel.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.986
Think of it as a roster of specialist helpers.
